  "description": "intfloat/multilingual-e5-small (revision 614241f6) sentence embeddings in the browser (Blazor WebAssembly and other .NET browser-wasm apps) on onnxruntime-web: the owned tokenizer (Starlings.Tokenizers) and the same padding, mean pooling and L2 normalization code as Starlings.Models.E5, async, plus a Microsoft.Extensions.AI IEmbeddingGenerator. Pins the fp32 graph (from the Hub) and the int8-embed variant (host it yourself) by SHA-256. Profiles multilingual-e5-small/onnx-fp32-wasm, onnx-int8embed-wasm (and -webgpu with Starlings.Runtime.OnnxWeb.WebGpu). WebAssembly has no support badge. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
